	"description": "现代闪念速记：极简无标题随手记、就地快速编辑、支持设置定时提醒，笔记与日历双视图合一。顶栏按钮打开全局浮窗，配合 AI 工具随时捕捉灵感与备忘。",
	"descriptionEn": "Modern quick-capture notes: frictionless title-free memos, rapid inline editing, scheduled reminders, and integrated notes & calendar tabs. A floating panel plus AI tools to capture ideas anytime.",
	"apiVersion": 2,
	"view": false,
	"preload": true,
	"permissions": ["ui", "http", "tools", "fs", "dom:anchor"],
	"settings": [
		{
			"key": "mirrorEnabled",
			"type": "boolean",
			"label": "镜像成 Markdown 文件（Mirror to Markdown）",
			"default": false,
			"hint": "每次改动把每篇笔记写成一个 .md，另生成 _todos.md / _reminders.md 两个汇总，放到下面那个目录里 —— 给 Obsidian / git 用。注意是**单向导出**：真相仍在插件自己的 json 库里，改镜像文件不会回流。"
		},
		{
			"key": "mirrorDir",
			"type": "text",
			"label": "镜像目录（绝对路径）",
			"default": "",
